          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|104|＝按玩家性别变化的兄弟称谓。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29317001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉莉奈",
          "text": "有新任务？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29317002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "没有什么任务，再也不会有人命令你做任何事了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29317003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉莉奈",
          "text": "这个不是预付的酬金？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29317004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这个只是送给你的礼物。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29317005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉莉奈",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29317006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不喜欢这个礼物吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29317007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉莉奈",
          "text": "很喜欢……这种情况，是应该说谢谢吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29317008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不说谢谢也没关系，只要你喜欢就好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29317009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉莉奈",
          "text": "……哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29317010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉莉奈",
          "text": "果然比起那个笨蛋哥哥，你才更适合做莉莉奈的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29317011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "啊？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29317012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "莉莉奈",
          "text": "|104|~我以后可以这么叫你吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
